{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_015_02_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:1323f1ce4bf72484ae348d12823a4f1156f7601ac42d40f28f203bdb24d9042f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_b:cmd-000011:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d9c4dd76884e0a96e05d915426e8d55fd2e7429eeb87e83a5c6c2470f31eeb5",
      "text": "贴这边会比较显眼吗？\n不对，稍微再偏右一点吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_b:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46a998b610ba1666998b46bcb16c23c977350cf739f90ea72b6f360ecd3b4469",
      "text": "……看到这张海报，\n试镜的报名者能增加就好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_b:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a20059f8b375b78c6c07cb0ec878de7490e66756b454040e9c5e18d9b26ff583",
      "text": "昨天也收到了一份新的报名。\n名字记得好像是叫，北村想乐先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4e5bfa7d5dfa6cdfdfa905c2476a181d190d177bde641f9d7caec81183c09de",
      "text": "照这个势头，继续寻找未来的偶像吧。\n好，最后再贴一张……哎呀！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a0fc6807cfa6faa5122a9e291ad63189e219283a18fadac88e9343a138039389",
      "text": "非常抱歉。\n打扰到您的工作了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36d0ae81895ea409bb82c64b4a1c453c2caa84ec994c722dde7dec77d673a4a6",
      "text": "哪里，我才是！……啊，您也要\n贴海报吧。请用，贴在这里……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c04c3e7f35cacffac6a523eec0d02c2578e38b7b8b203ee43544cfaab8b700ff",
      "text": "不，没关系的。\n这里还有空余的地方。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72905ab4e960a79f2708c13018da9f845b7776892b9dfb23f3fe47a9143eebba",
      "text": "而且……自己的研讨班就算贴在显眼的地方，\n也不会有什么效果吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b01037e65ceb889af7b7f3b15caa839a85e8064e28d6d305df6df1d8ba391fdd",
      "text": "研讨班……\n莫非，您是这所大学的老师吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:208b5c456a21eee431842295ec8af1dd0fb9d49fa37f3aa92e2b3dd2e708e53d",
      "text": "是的，我是助理教授。\n名叫古论克里斯。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
